            "review_title": "Review at Sua Chua Tran Chau",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nThe Original!\nJun 2020\nWe've gotten ourselves quite addicted to the Sữa Chua Trân châu locations in Hanoi. So, we jumped at the opportunity to try this delicious frozen yogurt in Halong. The prices were lower and the serving sizes larger than the Hanoi outlets. This place also served non-frozen yogurt snacks too. It was also nicely decorated with wood trim. This place is cash-only but is quite cheap. There were lots of families and young couples on dates when we went. It was very pleasant!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 9, 2020",
